</style><h2>BlinkyBot 0.3.4</h2><ul><li><strong>Each local CLI shows whether it is signed in.</strong> The row says not installed, not signed in, signed in, or unknown. Sign in opens that CLI’s own login in Terminal. BlinkyBot does not keep the token.</li><li><strong>Providers are added one at a time.</strong> The provider list starts empty. Add provider offers OpenAI, Anthropic, xAI, and OpenRouter. Removing one clears the key saved for it.</li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-bot/releases/tag/v0.3.4">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
